    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="0707" n="1441" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1441"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera, Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1896</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Barnum distributes relief without restraint at Harpoot. Statement published that
                    I advised missionaries to leave is not true. Have not given opinion, except
                    privately to Mr. Dwight. Such publication weakens my power to protect if they
                    remain. No concert to enforce tranquillity by the Powers; the Sultan knows
                    this.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
